<title>UK: Brazil adds 500 mln marks to 8.0 pct 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil adds 500 mln marks to 8.0 pct 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced on Tuesday, has been increased by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERATIVE REPUBLIC OF BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    *1.0 BLN DEM  COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    26.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+230 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1+10+100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0 PCT   SELL CONC  1.50 PCT  PRAECIPUUM  0.5 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT BUND DUE JANUARY 2007</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 500 MLN DEM ON 04.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
